{"id": "37003", "title": "巫妖异录", "author": "炽热天堂", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 136, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37003.htm", "intro": "《巫妖异录》炽热天堂  最新章节：\r\n第六十八章（大结局）\r\n\r\n\r\n内容简介：Tags: 巫妖、命运、王动、龙、仙人、魔鬼、巫门\r\n    在茫茫的宇宙当中，有着无数强大的存在。在这些存在之中，有着一个叫作命运之神的家伙，无穷无尽的生命终有一天令他产生了厌烦。于是，他把包含着自己几分力量的几颗小珠子射向了宇宙四面八方，等待着终有一天有人把所有的珠子收到一起，他将把自己的力量传承给那个半珠子收齐的人……\r\n\r\n　　巫妖，天下修行门派中最神秘的巫门之主，在他生下来的时候他便有着一种能力——一种看破命运的能力……", "base": "files/article/html/37/37003", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "楔子", "file": "2888318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "6492528.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "6492529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "6492530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2888319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "6492531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "6492532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "6492533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "6492534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "6492535.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "6492536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "6492537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "6492538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "6492539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "6492540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "6492541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "6492542.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "6492543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "6492544.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "6492545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "6492546.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "6492547.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "6492548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章